      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天。目白阿尔丹注意到\n樱花千代王和八重无敌这两人，\n会在“日本德比”对她造成威胁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37fc37fab1e9c08903abb77d15fe1e913b7eeee166b7d4f49361a7331d47c326",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
