      "source_text": "然后，她察觉自己是对那两人最近的\n优异表现感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8be378dacf5ac86d440cd640f2c78f575a8d1863784652ead62bc7cd37bc6ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
