      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹直到沉浸在胜利的喜悦中时，\n才察觉自己遗忘了要超越姐姐威望的目的，\n并明白了一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8296a31cef726406ff031685a915b2a6d4e0e0b44b757387e0409b03ab561e16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
